sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Voter Device
  participant R as Relay (multi-operator)
  participant P as PBB Log
  participant W as Witnesses

  Note over V: Fixed-size padded envelope + bounded random delay
  V->>R: Encrypted ballot submission (padded)
  Note over R: Cover traffic + batching (optional)
  R->>P: Batch commitment / submission
  P-->>R: IntakeReceipt / STH
  W->>P: Fetch STH + proofs
  W-->>V: Checkpoint head (quorum)
  V->>V: Verify inclusion against checkpoint
